<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Stripe was disconnected from your OTA</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>The Stripe account of your OTA {{tenantName}} ({{tenantKey}}) was disconnected from Velexis in Stripe. Velexis can no longer create card payments on it, so your storefront cannot take new card payments until you act.</p>
    <p>Velexis does not switch your payments to the Velexis Stripe account on its own. On the payments page, connect your Stripe account again, or choose Velexis payments: <a href="{{paymentsUrl}}">{{paymentsUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>If you did not disconnect it yourself, check who has access to your Stripe account.</p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
